Cell[TextData[{
 "Este examen supone entre 6 y 10 puntos de la nota final.\nNo se puede \
utilizar calculadora, ni reloj, s\[OAcute]lo bol\[IAcute]grafo y papel.\nEs \
fundamental que los ",
 StyleBox["razonamientos sean correctos",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " y que los resultados sean correctos ",
 StyleBox["cuando se puedan comprobar",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " y, si esto no es posible, que al menos los ",
 StyleBox["resultados no sean absurdos.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.610977073734375*^9, 3.610977077671875*^9}, {
   3.610977304453125*^9, 3.610977405828125*^9}, 3.6109946063489404`*^9, {
   3.610996437542557*^9, 3.6109964489149766`*^9}, 3.6424768970883904`*^9, 
   3.64541096253166*^9, {3.662402489289149*^9, 3.662402550060625*^9}, {
   3.724512051184802*^9, 3.7245120605916023`*^9}, {3.7245121063620024`*^9, 
   3.7245121068300023`*^9}, {3.8198801443272*^9, 3.8198801448862*^9}, {
   3.9448328131422215`*^9, 3.9448328157577777`*^9}},
 FontSize->16,
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"40887fa0-cd8a-42a8-8b9a-f3bfd125f268"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "\t1.- Demostrar por inducci\[OAcute]n que ",
 StyleBox["1*2 + 3*4 + 5*6 + ... + (2n-1)*(2n)",
  FontSize->18],
 " , es decir ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
      RowBox[{"i", "=", "1"}], "n"], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"2", "i"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"2", "i"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3dd060d8-2519-40a0-b67f-d63db55d2293"],
 " , es igual a  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    FractionBox["1", "3"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"f6cff23d-f8b0-4f02-82f2-0026f7e930ec"],
 StyleBox[" n*(n+1)*(4n-1)",
  FontSize->18],
 ", para todo n\[UAcute]mero natural ",
 StyleBox["n=1, 2, 3, ...",
  FontSize->18],
 " . ."
}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.500751345359375*^9, 3.500751379984375*^9}, {
   3.500790035609375*^9, 3.500790048953125*^9}, {3.569509423875*^9, 
   3.56950942659375*^9}, {3.570537368580125*^9, 3.57053737997075*^9}, {
   3.599199111625*^9, 3.5991991196875*^9}, {3.723477468774*^9, 
   3.723477473212*^9}, {3.723478212648*^9, 3.723478232406*^9}, {
   3.723478462157*^9, 3.723478463176*^9}, {3.723478670633*^9, 
   3.723478671652*^9}, {3.72356892631*^9, 3.7235690780550003`*^9}, {
   3.723569130146*^9, 3.723569177783*^9}, {3.7235692175769997`*^9, 
   3.723569247399*^9}, {3.723569308648*^9, 3.723569328826*^9}, {
   3.723569485984*^9, 3.723569513233*^9}, {3.7236081819960003`*^9, 
   3.7236083309300003`*^9}, {3.7236509376520233`*^9, 3.7236509459610233`*^9}, 
   3.7236517258530235`*^9, 3.723651765606024*^9, {3.7236521565550237`*^9, 
   3.7236522309350233`*^9}, {3.7238353873130035`*^9, 3.723835410693304*^9}, {
   3.7239071598070183`*^9, 3.723907162602418*^9}, {3.724158365534717*^9, 
   3.724158429733717*^9}, {3.724164938261321*^9, 3.724164963029321*^9}, 
   3.7254239244656124`*^9, {3.819906851493*^9, 3.8199068540039997`*^9}, {
   3.872560346715089*^9, 3.872560350646538*^9}, {3.8731155439905453`*^9, 
   3.8731155590517282`*^9}, {3.8731157020538797`*^9, 3.873115711210429*^9}, {
   3.8731157528993006`*^9, 3.873115770481827*^9}, {3.9125812640076947`*^9, 
   3.9125812700402637`*^9}, {3.912581484255684*^9, 3.9125815047523317`*^9}, {
   3.9125815549029922`*^9, 3.9125815649077168`*^9}, {3.912583519603179*^9, 
   3.9125835213860393`*^9}, {3.912611582080784*^9, 3.9126115822927303`*^9}, 
   3.9448943936111383`*^9, {3.9458561115023975`*^9, 3.945856144221467*^9}, {
   3.9458634562240443`*^9, 3.9458634580936837`*^9}, 3.9470826844650517`*^9},
 FontFamily->"Arial",
 FontSize->18,
 FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0.25098039215686274`, 0.5019607843137255],
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.807843137254902, 0.9058823529411765, 
   1.],ExpressionUUID->"628e1315-970f-41e4-9771-8bb672dc5aa8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Soluci\[OAcute]n:\nPara realizar la demostraci\[OAcute]n por inducci\
\[OAcute]n, comenzamos estudiando el primer caso, n=1. \n1) Caso n=1.\nEl \
primer t\[EAcute]rmino, que empieza con 1*2, debe terminar cuando n=1 con \
(2*1-1)*(2*1)=1*2, por tanto se reduce a un sumando. La igualdad que habr\
\[IAcute]a que comprobar es:\n\t\t\t\t\t ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"1", "*", "2"}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "1", "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", "*", "1"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2abdcbe8-cd06-4b5c-8f28-de1851f924bb"],
 ".\nEs inmediato comprobar que ambas expresiones valen 2.\n\t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"1", "*", "2"}], "=", "2", " "}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1fcb690d-f6bf-4d26-b8ad-e3e9b9cc9c48"],
 "\t  \t\t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "1", "*", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"4", "*", "1"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "2", "*", "3"}], "=", "2"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"f9711065-9651-4179-bfbc-acb33607a075"],
 "\n2) En la segunda parte del m\[EAcute]todo de inducci\[OAcute]n, se supone \
que la propiedad es cierta para un valor n y se trata de comprobar que tambi\
\[EAcute]n lo ser\[IAcute]a para (n+1).\n\nEs decir, si la igualdad es cierta \
para n, \n\t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "*", "2"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"3", "*", "4"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"5", "*", "6"}], "+"}], "..."}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "n"}], ")"}]}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "n", "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d2fdbd6e-c1b9-45ec-92bd-d79219ad3e1b"],
 ", \nse tratar\[IAcute]a de demostrar que tambi\[EAcute]n lo es para (n+1).\n\
\nEscribimos la expresi\[OAcute]n para n+1.\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "*", "2"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"3", "*", "4"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"5", "*", "6"}], "+"}], "..."}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "n"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "*", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e5bab3ec-7252-4c6d-a127-516a7a60f6eb"],
 " .\n\nPara ver que es cierta esta nueva expresi\[OAcute]n, observamos que \
en la primera parte aparece la suma del caso n. Por tanto, usando que el caso \
n es cierto, escribimos\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "*", "2"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"3", "*", "4"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"5", "*", "6"}], "+"}], "..."}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "n"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "*", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "n", "*", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"2", "*", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "n", "*", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "+", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "."}]}]}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "aee9fb95-3ef5-4282-9ceb-f0cce70b6372"],
 " \n\nLa segunda parte de la expresi\[OAcute]n del caso n+1 es:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "2"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "+", "3"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6e6e915f-cd9d-416a-9b09-1e36dd5aff9e"],
 ".\n\nPor tanto, tendr\[IAcute]amos que comprobar que \n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", "n", "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "+", "2"}], ")"}]}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "3"], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "2"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "+", "3"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2e5eb0c6-24e3-4846-b78a-fca0253f5e8d"],
 ".\n\nO lo que es lo mismo, dividiendo por (n+1) y multiplicando por 3, hay \
que comprobar que:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"n", "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{"3", "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", "2"}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "2"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "+", "3"}], ")"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "743433fb-b284-4293-8696-d5a1ab5ad856"],
 ".\n\nOperando en ambos lados, obtenemos que la expresi\[OAcute]n de la \
izquierda vale:\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"n", "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{"3", "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "n"}], "+", "1"}], ")"}], "*", "2"}]}],
     FontSize->18], 
    StyleBox["=",
     FontSize->18], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["4",
        FontSize->18], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["n",
         FontSize->18], "2"]}], 
      StyleBox["-",
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox["n",
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox["+",
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"12", "n"}],
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox["+",
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox["6",
       FontSize->18]}], 
     StyleBox["=",
      FontSize->18], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["4",
        FontSize->18], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["n",
         FontSize->18], "2"]}], "+", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"11", "n"}],
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox["+",
       FontSize->18], 
      StyleBox["6",
       FontSize->18]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "80a6dabf-07b3-4c11-b38e-2672a3bcc03a"],
 "\n\nY la segunda expresi\[OAcute]n vale:\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "2"}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", "n"}], "+", "3"}], ")"}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"4", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["n",
          FontSize->18], "2"]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"3", "n"}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"8", "n"}], "+", "6"}], "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"4", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["n",
          FontSize->18], "2"]}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"11", "n"}], "+", "6"}]}]}],
    FontSize->18], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f7ca4cd6-8e91-419e-b339-7b187cf6c430"],
 "\n\nSe obtiene id\[EAcute]ntico resultado en los dos miembros de la expresi\
\[OAcute]n y concluimos que de ser cierta la igualdad para n, tambi\[EAcute]n \
lo es para (n+1). \n\nHabiendo realizado los dos pasos de las demostraciones \
por el m\[EAcute]todo de inducci\[OAcute]n, concluimos que la igualdad es \
cierta para todo n\[UAcute]mero natural, n = 1, 2, 3, ..."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.610967983265625*^9, 3.610968082640625*^9}, {
   3.6109681208125*^9, 3.61096812653125*^9}, {3.610976777453125*^9, 
   3.610976922484375*^9}, {3.610977092296875*^9, 3.610977097484375*^9}, {
   3.6109946522286205`*^9, 3.610994704129912*^9}, {3.610995052572124*^9, 
   3.6109950884521875`*^9}, {3.6424689091182065`*^9, 
   3.6424689136494656`*^9}, {3.64246910935966*^9, 3.6424691148089714`*^9}, {
   3.642469284504678*^9, 3.642469286029765*^9}, {3.6424701665631285`*^9, 
   3.6424702113606906`*^9}, {3.642470588749276*^9, 3.642470640499236*^9}, {
   3.6424722530694695`*^9, 3.6424723052424536`*^9}, {3.645409112709856*^9, 
   3.645409129264803*^9}, {3.645409338631778*^9, 3.645409352426567*^9}, {
   3.6624029068280306`*^9, 3.662402929918351*^9}, {3.662402962912238*^9, 
   3.662403136744181*^9}, {3.6624095052454386`*^9, 3.662409542385563*^9}, {
   3.662413401773307*^9, 3.6624134164051437`*^9}, {3.6624326047128563`*^9, 
   3.6624326536041436`*^9}, {3.693853579308857*^9, 3.6938536913412647`*^9}, {
   3.6938543953475313`*^9, 3.693854402346932*^9}, 3.693854607431662*^9, {
   3.7076653310638204`*^9, 3.7076653348368206`*^9}, 3.724512074101202*^9, {
   3.7245159054844255`*^9, 3.724515919898026*^9}, {3.739552763511801*^9, 
   3.7395528248498006`*^9}, {3.7395534219308004`*^9, 
   3.7395534250038004`*^9}, {3.7395534800158005`*^9, 3.739553483511801*^9}, {
