  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"a50bf1d2-404c-4380-bbd0-d13d1add077c"],
 "=",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"A", "(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"n", "+", "3"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{"Bn", "(", 
      RowBox[{"n", "+", "3"}], ")"}], "+", 
     RowBox[{"Cn", "(", 
      RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"n", "(", 
      RowBox[{"n", "+", "1"}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"n", "+", "3"}], ")"}]}]], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"8a35fdf2-a91c-400c-9f65-aecc474cd7e1"],
 "\n\t\t\n\t\t6n+12 = A(n+1)(n+3) + Bn(n+3) + Cn(n+1)\nPara encontrar A, B y \
C, sustituimos en la expresi\[OAcute]n anterior n por 0, -1 y -3:\n\n\tn=0\t\t\
6*0+12= A(0+1)(0+3)+B*0*(0+3)+C*0*(0+1) \[DoubleLongRightArrow] 12= 3A \
\[DoubleLongRightArrow] A= 4\n\tn=-1\t\t6*(-1)+12= \
A(-1+1)(-1+3)+B*(-1)*(-1+3)+C*(-1)*(-1+1) \[DoubleLongRightArrow] 6= -2B \
\[DoubleLongRightArrow] B= -3\n\tn=-3\t\t6*(-3)+12= \
A(-3+1)(-3+3)+B*(-3)*(-3+3)+C*(-3)*(-3+1) \[DoubleLongRightArrow] -6= 6C \
\[DoubleLongRightArrow] C= -1\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["a", "n"], "="}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"5616fb38-3cb9-4123-96ff-a919eeacd0d9"],
