Cell[TextData[{
 "Soluci\[OAcute]n:\nLa suma de las distancias, en funci\[OAcute]n de \
\[Alpha], es f(\[Alpha]) = (5-\[Alpha]) + 2 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["1", "2"]}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2b5f59e8-0039-480c-ace9-ea235ea2a7dc"],
 " , con \[Alpha] en [0,5].\nSe trata de una funci\[OAcute]n continua en un \
intervalo cerrado y acotado. Por el teorema de Weierstrass, tiene \
m\[AAcute]ximo y m\[IAcute]nimo absolutos. Los m\[AAcute]ximos y \
m\[IAcute]nimos absolutos pueden estar en los extremos, en los puntos con \
derivada cero o en los puntos sin derivada.\nLa funci\[OAcute]n es derivable. \
La derivada es f \[CloseCurlyQuote](\[Alpha]) = -1 + 2\[Alpha]/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], "+", "1"}]], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"03d7cadc-ae71-4061-9d5b-ba7fb4d25fdc"],
 ".  Igualando la derivada a cero,  \n\t\t-1 + 2\[Alpha]/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], "+", "1"}]], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"61a16e50-c57f-4b62-9498-7a613c3e2339"],
 " = 0 \[DoubleLongRightArrow]  2\[Alpha] =",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], "+", "1"}]], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"4dfb6445-7e92-4def-b4d7-b306b463405f"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] 4 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9b6cca4c-de7d-4b30-8aa0-24e8d9e84211"],
 " = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"876ea7b0-31f9-44d1-8e02-1d141f19eb31"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] 3 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "cd2a2060-1a83-47dd-ace0-66b3a9a0c036"],
 " = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["1", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a0a7063a-144e-404f-b97e-0241bf5c0d8d"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c3db53ec-244b-40e7-935a-fb42a4a5bf62"],
 " = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "187782d3-c057-4e27-b9a8-265feb9ba27b"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] \[Alpha] = 1/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e12e8816-6bbb-4ea9-add4-8cc4408b021b"],
 " (\[Alpha] = - 1/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3855f453-b791-473f-91a4-bb4f12f1d0e6"],
 " no es soluci\[OAcute]n, ni est\[AAcute] en el dominio).\n\nAhora evaluamos \
en los extremos y en el punto de derivada cero. \n\tf(0) = (5-0) + 2 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["0", "2"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["1", "2"]}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b9a7b872-909a-4735-9d03-f083ffe7a9ef"],
 " = 5 + 2 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "767a2ea9-c58a-4988-9318-016e1036c7dc"],
 " = 7, \n\tf(5) = (5-5) + 2 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["5", "2"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["1", "2"]}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1802aa7e-bca4-4d2e-ab3f-7567513d2566"],
 " = 2 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["5", "2"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["1", "2"]}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "92c574d4-63ed-48e3-8602-22c2119aae1b"],
 " = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SqrtBox["26"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a722b651-49d0-4c56-a097-94e437109aa6"],
 "  (Es mayor que 10),\n\tf(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    FormBox[
     SqrtBox["3"],
     TraditionalForm]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5a97191f-2ec1-4e7b-87c2-23962f7eadb4"],
 ") = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"5", "-", 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", 
       FormBox[
        SqrtBox["3"],
        TraditionalForm]}]}], ")"}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"2", 
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "3"}], "+", "1"}]]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"6ad170b6-38ca-4cd2-ac61-56605ba0ac8d"],
 "= ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"5", 
        SqrtBox["3"]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "/", 
     FormBox[
      SqrtBox["3"],
      TraditionalForm]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"2", 
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{"4", "/", "3"}]]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "dfb5a4ba-b266-4c7c-90ef-f2973c43140a"],
 "=",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"5", 
        SqrtBox["3"]}], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "/", 
     FormBox[
      SqrtBox["3"],
      TraditionalForm]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"4", "/", 
     SqrtBox["3"]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fd6170ce-1be2-4a45-b552-c55ca5c36f7c"],
 " =",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"5", 
       SqrtBox["3"]}], "+", "3"}], ")"}], "/", 
    FormBox[
     SqrtBox["3"],
     TraditionalForm]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f1b56b23-f05b-4777-8882-d98fcd7c12f5"],
 "= 5 +",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "069e73fb-13c9-449c-a2b8-688e692f6df0"],
 " (es menor que 7).\n\tEl m\[IAcute]nimo es 5 +",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8ba2d46a-3bba-47f1-bdd7-b9171909ddda"],
 " y se alcanza cuando \[Alpha] = 1/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SqrtBox["3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "841e8c27-972c-4330-968e-6cfa37b82a19"],
 ". \n\nCon el Mathematica,"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.610967983265625*^9, 3.610968082640625*^9}, {
