Cell[TextData[{
 "Soluci\[OAcute]n:\nLa funci\[OAcute]n es un polinomio de grado 3, es por \
tanto una funci\[OAcute]n continua y derivable en toda la recta real.\n\t",
 StyleBox["f(x) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["x", "3"], "-", 
    RowBox[{"3", "x"}], "-", "5"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"cded5c95-ca11-43b3-ab5c-b470b710d12c"],
 "; ",
 StyleBox["f \[CloseCurlyQuote](x) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"3", 
     SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}], "-", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"30b59fc1-bf57-4b14-be65-05d76e0d2c15"],
 "; ",
 StyleBox["f \[OpenCurlyQuote]\[CloseCurlyQuote](x) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"6", "x"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"e0184f3b-46fa-4b51-995d-e4ee57ae03dc"],
 "\n\t\n\t",
 StyleBox["f(0) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", "5"}], "<", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"189af17a-1d49-41fa-9d03-b0b4bd6c6d4d"],
 ",\n\t",
 StyleBox["f(3) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["3", "3"], "-", 
     RowBox[{"3", "*", "3"}], "-", "5"}], "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"27", "-", "9", "-", "5"}], "=", 
     RowBox[{"13", ">", "0"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"2900e35b-129d-49c2-8007-3f276ce2222f"],
 "\n\t\n\tAl evaluar en los puntos 0 y 3, vemos que hay cambio de signo de la \
funci\[OAcute]n f. Utilizando el teorema de Bolzano, como f es una funci\
\[OAcute]n continua en el intervalo [0,3] y tiene signos opuestos en los \
extremos, podemos asegurar que hay al menos una ra\[IAcute]z en [0,3].\n\t\n\t\
",
 StyleBox["f \[OpenCurlyQuote](x) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"3", 
      SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}], "-", "3"}], "=", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"f9f391bc-0d63-4aee-88bb-307ba8eec419"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"3", 
     SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}], "=", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"8f921550-f8bb-497c-b729-ad0c9f26b641"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "=", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"f3f3ec4f-3e4f-415d-8469-68d7809acb89"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"x", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "\[OAcute]", " ", "1"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"395c23ea-da95-45d9-aabe-9d3b268f9e1d"],
 ".\n\t\n\tLa derivada de f(x) se anula en los puntos -1 y 1. Para conocer el \
crecimiento de f(x), evaluamos f \[CloseCurlyQuote](x) antes del -1 (por \
ejemplo, en -2), entre el -1 y el 1 (por ejemplo, el 0) y despu\[EAcute]s del \
1 (por ejemplo, el 2). \n\t\t\t",
 StyleBox["f \[OpenCurlyQuote](-2) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"3", "*", 
      SuperscriptBox["2", "2"]}], "-", "3"}], " ", "=", " ", "9"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"31641d90-ffe4-4a22-ba7f-85aa31bffc21"],
 "\n\t\t\t",
 StyleBox["f \[OpenCurlyQuote](0) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"3", "*", 
      SuperscriptBox["0", "2"]}], "-", "3"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"-", "3"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"815ee713-e464-41e7-a28c-496839bbf427"],
 "\n\t\t\t",
 StyleBox["f \[OpenCurlyQuote](2) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"3", "*", 
      SuperscriptBox["2", "2"]}], "-", "3"}], "=", " ", "9"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"6d91b1f9-6b86-42a2-b36e-e25c5916fead"],
 "\n\tAdem\[AAcute]s, los valores de f en -1 y en 1 son:\t\t\n\t\t\t",
 StyleBox["f(-1) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ")"}], "3"], "-", 
     RowBox[{"3", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ")"}]}], "-", "5"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"-", "3"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"38ff8da6-5004-406d-8dea-64f1d16b508b"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["f(1) = ",
  FontSize->18],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["1", "3"], "-", 
     RowBox[{"3", "*", "1"}], "-", "5"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"-", "7"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"a67c5bad-ac30-45d1-aafb-ec424c2ab5f9"],
 "\n\tPor tanto, f es creciente en (-\[Infinity],-1). En -1, donde f vale -3, \
hay un m\[AAcute]ximo local o relativo. En (-1,1), f es decreciente. En 1, \
donde f vale -7, hay un m\[IAcute]nimo local o relativo. En (1,\[Infinity]), \
f es creciente.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  GraphicsBox[{{{}, {}, 
     TagBox[
      {RGBColor[0.368417, 0.506779, 0.709798], AbsoluteThickness[1.6], 
       Opacity[1.], LineBox[CompressedData["
