Cell[TextData[{
 "Soluci\[OAcute]n:\nSe trata de aproximar la soluci\[OAcute]n de una ecuaci\
\[OAcute]n diferencial con una condici\[OAcute]n inicial en un punto. \nLa \
ecuaci\[OAcute]n diferencial es ",
 StyleBox["y\[CloseCurlyQuote] =  y + x - 1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". \nLa condici\[OAcute]n inicial es y(0)=1. \nHay que aproximar el valor de \
y(4).\nEl m\[EAcute]todo para hacerlo es el de Taylor de segundo orden. Este \
m\[EAcute]todo, utiliza no solo la primera derivada (como hace el \
m\[EAcute]todo de Euler), tambi\[EAcute]n usa la derivada segunda para tratar \
de avanzar con m\[AAcute]s precisi\[OAcute]n en cada salto.\nEl salto se hace \
con paso h=2. Por tanto, necesitaremos dar dos saltos para llegar  al punto \
4.\n\nLa primera derivada de y, y\[CloseCurlyQuote], es igual a y+x-1=f(x,y).\
\nLa segunda derivada de y ser\[AAcute]:\ny\[CloseCurlyQuote]\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] = (y\[CloseCurlyQuote])\[CloseCurlyQuote] = (y+x-1)\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] = y\[CloseCurlyQuote] + 1 + 0 = (y+x-1) + 1 = y + x  \
=g(x,y)\n\nUtilizando la primera y segunda derivada, la aproximaci\[OAcute]n \
por Taylor en cada punto vendr\[AAcute] dada por \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["y", 
      RowBox[{"i", "+", "1"}]], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["y", "i"], "+", 
      RowBox[{"h", " ", 
       RowBox[{"f", "(", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["x", 
          RowBox[{"i", " "}]], ",", " ", 
         SubscriptBox["y", 
          RowBox[{"i", " "}]]}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox[
        SuperscriptBox["h", "2"], "2"], 
       RowBox[{"g", 
        StyleBox["(",
         FontWeight->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["x", 
           RowBox[{"i", " "}]], ",", " ", 
          SubscriptBox["y", 
           RowBox[{"i", " "}]]}],
         FontWeight->"Plain"], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontWeight->"Plain"]}]}]}]}],
    FontWeight->"Plain"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"08e998b2-2cd4-4cbc-95be-b9e8625c436c"],
 "\n\nEn nuestro caso;\nf(x,y) = x+y-1;\ng(x,y)=x+y;\nh=2\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["x", "0"], 
    StyleBox["=",
     FontWeight->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["0",
     FontWeight->"Plain"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "705f1600-7693-4747-891d-222d9db20e92"],
 "; \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["x", "1"], "="}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "787eac9e-c5a3-4bc2-8795-f21e71d7bbb8"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["x", "0"], "+", " ", "h"}], 
    StyleBox["=",
     FontWeight->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"0", "+", "2"}], "=", "2"}],
     FontWeight->"Plain"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2e12d789-bc9d-4380-9dc1-6ec6ef0c0828"],
 "; \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["x", "2"], 
    StyleBox["=",
     FontWeight->"Plain"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6fcf8ce-3bd9-4d8c-ae05-7b3175882325"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["x", "1"], "+", "h"}], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"2", "+", "2"}], "=", "4"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "93da7ff7-4118-49a9-848a-ba61ad577f4c"],
 "; \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["y", "0"], "=", "1"}],
    FontWeight->"Plain"], TraditionalForm]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"d42c27d9-d36c-44f5-88d2-63e0a95f1255"],
 ";\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["y", "1"], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["y", "0"], "+", 
      RowBox[{"h", " ", 
       RowBox[{"f", "(", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["x", 
          RowBox[{"0", " "}]], ",", " ", 
         SubscriptBox["y", 
          RowBox[{"0", " "}]]}], ")"}]}], "+", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox[
        SuperscriptBox["h", "2"], "2"], 
       RowBox[{"g", "(", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["x", "0"], ",", " ", 
         SubscriptBox["y", 
          RowBox[{"0", " "}]]}], ")"}]}]}]}],
    FontWeight->"Plain"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1ecfb8f4-5964-4391-99d6-5cfa8caa7c86"],
 " \[DoubleLongRightArrow] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox[
     SubscriptBox["y", "1"],
     FontWeight->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["=",
     FontWeight->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["1",
      FontWeight->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["+",
      FontWeight->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["2",
       FontWeight->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["*",
       FontWeight->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox[" ",
       FontWeight->"Plain"], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["f",
        FontWeight->"Plain"], "(", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["0", " "], ",", " ", 
        SubscriptBox["1", " "]}], 
       StyleBox[")",
        FontWeight->"Plain"]}]}], 
     StyleBox["+",
      FontWeight->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox[
       FractionBox[
